**Key exports**: `app` (FastAPI instance). Routes group into: provider CRUD (`config/providers.json`), `/api/parse-intent` (best-effort target extraction, never blocks), scan lifecycle (`POST /api/scan`, cancel/pause/resume/steer/ask), live-inspector reads (`/surface`, `/audit`, `/evidence`, **`/agents`** — the v4 R3c per-lane grouping), and export (`/api/scan/{id}/export?format=markdown|json|bundle|sarif|evidence|html|pdf|docx`).

